<title>UK: IBCA rates Dah Sing floating CD A minus.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates Dah Sing floating CD A minus.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>European rating agency IBCA said on Friday it assigned an A minus long-term rating to Dah Sing Bank's HK$1.2 billion floating rate certificates of deposit.</p>
<p>&quot;Dah Sing is a medium sized commercial bank in Honk Kong with a growing presence in the retail market,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The bank is funded mainly through customer deposits, which are short-term, but it is active in the residential mortgage lending and the issue of CDs represents a useful source of medium-term funding,&quot; IBCA said.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6784</p>
</text>
